# Key Findings

## Finding 1

AI Engineer, Machine Learning Engineer, and Generative AI Engineer are among the most demanded positions.

## Finding 2

LLM-focused roles command significantly higher salaries than traditional AI positions.

## Finding 3

Python is the most requested technical skill, appearing in a majority of job postings.

## Finding 4

Healthcare and Finance are emerging as major consumers of AI talent.

## Finding 5

Remote work has become a mainstream offering within AI hiring.

## Finding 6

Organizations pay substantial premiums for advanced AI and Generative AI expertise.

